<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edged down to 1.793 from 1.788 per dlr in.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edged down to 1.793 from 1.788 per dlr in.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged down to 1.793 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.788 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    October 28	   October 25</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1.793		  1.788</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $7.030 million	   $7.620 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
